    <Comments>Two-page spread, left page numbered 84 in pencil. Reading order: left page then right page. Some word readings are uncertain because of the flowing hand (e.g. 'Dieser da', 'vereinigten', 'erblick-', 'Kaskel'). Underlinings in the original are not marked. 'erblick-' hyphen ends the line; the line break after 'Dieser da' was read as is. Date and signature are placed at lower right; the page is partly cut off at right edge.; script=kurrent</Comments>
